# Astro Conventions (Mr. Brij)

## Config

- `site: 'https://brijendrasingh.github.io'`, `base: '/'`, `output: 'static'`
- Contact/social links: import from `src/config/site.ts` — never hardcode

## Components

- Use `.astro` for layouts and static components
- Tailwind for styling; keep professional minimal palette (slate/navy, blue accent)
- Semantic HTML; accessible nav and headings

## Blog

- Posts in `src/content/blog/` with content collection schema
- URL: `/blog/{slug}/` where slug = filename without extension
- Filter `draft: true` posts from production listings

## Build

Run `npm run build` before claiming work complete.
